[00:17.00]Produced by：Mayonazy
[00:26.00]Glittering tears are falling down on the sidewalk
[00:26.00]晶莹泪珠坠落在人行道上
[00:29.00]Time won't let me wait another day while I'm thinking of
[00:29.00]思绪翻涌，时光不再为我停留
[00:32.00]The sadness behind your smile
[00:32.00]藏在你笑容背后的哀伤
[00:37.00]My dreams dissolve like shining rays on the dew drops
[00:37.00]美梦消散，如同露珠上闪烁微光
[00:39.00]Now it's disappeared I know that I can never hold on
[00:39.00]一切已然消逝，我明白无法再挽留
