[01:07.00]脑海浮现
[01:09.00]My reflection brightest sunlight
[01:09.00]我的身影，沐浴璀璨日光
[01:10.00]Ran too far forgot my name
[01:10.00]奔赴远方，迷失自我
[01:11.00]Falling tears still shine like dreams,
[01:11.00]滴落泪水依旧如梦闪耀
[01:13.00]Turning the pain to brighter days.
